# FrcMathlib.Theme.Quantum — the quantum theme on Mathlib: the ledger's identities (22-quantum, 15 October 2026)

What the core states on every shell (`FrcCore/Theme/Observation.lean`, `Interference.lean`, `Composite.lean`) is read
here on the ledger itself:

