/-- 21:C9 — anti-self-adjointness of the central difference on the cycle `ℤ/N`: with
`(Δf)(x) = f(x + 1) − f(x − 1)`, `Σ_x f(x)(Δg)(x) = −Σ_x (Δf)(x) g(x)` — `Δᵀ = −Δ`, the identity that carries
